autosaxs skill outputs are always nanometers (`q` in nm^-1, lengths in nm).
Be careful, since some ATSAS components (like DAMMIF) expect or output A^-1 or try to guess the units from the data.
You should always check for unit coherence based on "`q` in nm^-1, lengths in nm" convention.
